### One request per outcome. Start everything with `docker compose up --build`, then run these
### from IntelliJ (or VS Code with the REST Client extension).
### The bank simulator decides by the card's last digit: odd = Authorized, even = Declined,
### 0 = bank error.

@gateway = http://localhost:8090

### Authorized (201), and remember the id for the GET below
POST {{gateway}}/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "card_number": "2222405343248877",
  "expiry_month": 4,
  "expiry_year": 2030,
  "currency": "GBP",
  "amount": 1050,
  "cvv": "123"
}

> {% client.global.set("paymentId", response.body.id); %}

### Retrieve the payment above (200)
GET {{gateway}}/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}

### Declined (201)
POST {{gateway}}/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "card_number": "2222405343248112",
  "expiry_month": 12,
  "expiry_year": 2030,
  "currency": "USD",
  "amount": 1,
  "cvv": "1234"
}

### Bank error (502): no payment was made, safe to retry
POST {{gateway}}/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "card_number": "2222405343248870",
  "expiry_month": 4,
  "expiry_year": 2030,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "amount": 1050,
  "cvv": "123"
}

### Rejected (400): every invalid field is listed, and the bank is never called
POST {{gateway}}/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "card_number": "1234",
  "expiry_month": 13,
  "expiry_year": 2020,
  "currency": "JPY",
  "amount": 0,
  "cvv": "12"
}

### Rejected (400): the body isn't valid JSON of the expected shape
POST {{gateway}}/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{"card_number": "2222405343248877", "amount": 10.5}

### Unknown payment (404)
GET {{gateway}}/v1/payments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Malformed payment id (400)
GET {{gateway}}/v1/payments/not-a-uuid

### Readiness probe
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/health/readiness

### Prometheus metrics (look for payments_processed_total)
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/prometheus
